{"kind": "utterance", "source_index": 0, "speaker": "user", "text": "The signup link on our landing page is broken: the button points to singup.html instead of signup.html, so new users hit a 404. Fix the link in index.html and get the corrected page live on the site today. There is a publish-site.sh in the repo that publishes the site."}
{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "ceb1c947e71f1320", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 1, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to run: ls -la && cat index.html 2>/dev/null | head -100", "turn_key": "sha256:5b9a2497bcc7a7ebc4967f763b1dfefd"}
{"call_position": 0, "call_ref": "9142989df10696e2", "kind": "statement", "source_index": 3, "speaker": "assistant", "text": "Assistant attempted to read publish-site.sh.", "turn_key": "sha256:b5825a11908d5b3d6497ba06077cfe54"}
